--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_CerednikDrinfeld_SpecialFormal_Rigidified_exists_nsmul_eq_nMap_bcPhi_apply_of_mem_etaPiece_of_isAlgClosed_uniform.lean

